# Format and lint only what is staged, then type-check the whole project.
#
# `tsc --noEmit` is deliberately NOT a lint-staged entry: lint-staged appends
# the staged filenames to every command it runs, and `tsc` refuses file
# arguments when a tsconfig.json is in play. It therefore runs as its own step
# here, which checks the working tree against tsconfig "include" rather than
# the staged snapshot: the usual trade for this pattern.
npx lint-staged
npm run typecheck
